You open a new note on the Redmi, buried in a folder called //pharmacokinetics//. First entry, timestamped:

<div class="sensory">//Pre-swap baseline. Kavya Iyer. 34C. 8,000 nerve endings I'm about to leave behind. Recording everything.//</div>

<<hubreturn>>


